9542        * Source: S154 / Chapter 73 / `Kernel Density Estimates` (PDF pp. 5406–5407); S154 / Chapter 73 / `Binning` (PDF pp. 5407–5409); S154 / Chapter
9542     ! 73 / `Kernel Distribution Estimates` (PDF pp. 5409–5411).
9543        * Discriminates: Example 73.5: Univariate KDE Graphics
9544        */
9545       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
9545     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
9546       %let syscc=0;
9547       title; footnote;
9548       ods _all_ close;
9549       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
9550       ods graphics off;
9551       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.BIVNORMAL (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASMAC2 (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
